WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:03.848
Unit seven. Universal Health Coverage!

2
00:00:04.765 --> 00:00:08.996
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Sokha, your school doctor.

3
00:00:09.046 --> 00:00:12.023
Hi, Doctor Sokha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.073 --> 00:00:16.544
Today we learn about Universal Health Coverage. Let's go!

5
00:00:18.050 --> 00:00:23.617
Universal health coverage. Say it with me. Universal health coverage!

6
00:00:27.086 --> 00:00:31.320
Access. Say it with me. Access!

7
00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:39.202
Affordability. Say it with me. Affordability!

8
00:00:42.688 --> 00:00:47.104
Primary care. Say it with me. Primary care!

9
00:00:50.587 --> 00:00:55.621
Financial protection. Say it with me. Financial protection!

10
00:00:59.158 --> 00:01:02.858
Equity. Say it with me. Equity!

11
00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:10.510
Health system. Say it with me. Health system!

12
00:01:13.976 --> 00:01:17.809
Policy. Say it with me. Policy!

13
00:01:21.352 --> 00:01:33.617
Universal health coverage means everyone can get the care they need without financial hardship. It relies on strong primary care, financial protection, equity, and good health system policy.

14
00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:36.890
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Sokha!

15
00:01:37.646 --> 00:01:42.993
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:43.043 --> 00:01:44.377
Affordability!

17
00:01:45.397 --> 00:01:50.803
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.853 --> 00:01:52.218
Health system!

19
00:01:53.165 --> 00:01:59.566
Did you know? Universal health coverage is part of the UN Sustainable Development Goals!

20
00:01:59.616 --> 00:02:01.977
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:02.936 --> 00:02:12.020
Think and answer. Why is financial protection important in healthcare?

22
00:02:12.070 --> 00:02:13.220
Great answer!

23
00:02:14.176 --> 00:02:19.262
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
